[stuff]
<h1>Miscellaneous</h1>
<br>Well, firstly I must give credit to those whose work on editing inspired and helped me to learn the process of coding a Netstorm campaign. I thank Chamber for the time saving .english creator, rahns guide to level editing was also helpful, and my understanding was also much improved by looking at the choice .english files, so thanks to swelb for that. The main help though was of course, NEC. I thank Higlander and the others for setting up a great website whick expains things brilliantly.</br>
<br>What was the hardest thing about making this campaign? Making the guide file! I lost count of the amount of times Netstorm crashed because my guide file was too big. This was because I didn't understand the OR command as applied to variables. As far as I can tell it only registers variables that are on, you can't tell it do do something if ~IX~. is off OR ~IY~. is off.</br>
<br>Next, be ready for my next Netstorm campaign, it's even more ambitious than this one was but thats all I'm saying at the moment. Keep an eye on my website too. I'm still learning HTML but theres some great stuff lined up for that site. You won't see me on Nestorm much, maybe weekday evenings or saturday afternoon, UK time, but I'm only on about once/twice a week after my parents read the last phone bill!! :(
